# MegaFlash Apple-bus bring-up for MAME bridge (-a2bus-bridge).
# PHI0 so IsAppleConnected(); core1launch for BusLoop. No USB console.
# Launch core1 early so BusLoop RAM stays intact during cyw43_arch_init.
# Wall-time driven under a2bus (see main.c script_poll).

10ms: gpio20 1
10ms: gpio19 0
50ms: a2phi
100ms: core1launch
